1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
Learn Shapes with Mimo!

2
00:00:07,107 --> 00:00:12,142
Mimo: Hi friends! It's me, Mimo! Today we're going on a shape hunt!

3
00:00:13,742 --> 00:00:18,693
Mimo: Shapes are everywhere! Let's find them together. Are you ready?

4
00:00:20,428 --> 00:00:22,323
Bruno: A shape hunt? Are shapes yummy?

5
00:00:24,623 --> 00:00:29,402
Mimo: Shapes aren't food, Bruno! You'll see. Let's start!

6
00:00:30,052 --> 00:00:35,248
Mimo: First shape! It's round, round, round, with no corners at all.

7
00:00:37,148 --> 00:00:38,177
Mimo: A circle!

8
00:00:38,477 --> 00:00:39,980
Mimo: Can you say circle?

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:50,380
Mimo: Great job! Can you find a circle? Look! The sun is a circle! And a ball is a circle too!

10
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,318
Bruno: And a cookie is a circle! A yummy circle!

11
00:00:57,218 --> 00:01:00,776
Mimo: Silly Bruno! Yes, a cookie is a circle.

12
00:01:01,076 --> 00:01:06,149
Mimo: Next shape! It has four sides, and they're all the same size.

13
00:01:08,049 --> 00:01:09,108
Mimo: A square!

14
00:01:09,408 --> 00:01:10,939
Mimo: Can you say square?

15
00:01:14,339 --> 00:01:17,240
Mimo: Look! This present box is a square!

16
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:20,329
Bruno: And a sandwich is a square! A yummy square!

17
00:01:22,229 --> 00:01:25,127
Mimo: Bruno! Is everything food to you?

18
00:01:25,427 --> 00:01:26,950
Bruno: Mostly, yes.

19
00:01:28,572 --> 00:01:31,354
Pip: Hi everybody! Can I hunt for shapes too?

20
00:01:31,654 --> 00:01:36,656
Mimo: Yes, Pip! This shape has three sides and three pointy corners.

21
00:01:38,556 --> 00:01:39,697
Pip: A triangle!

22
00:01:39,997 --> 00:01:41,604
Mimo: Can you say triangle?

23
00:01:45,004 --> 00:01:49,920
Pip: A tent is a triangle! When we went camping, our tent was a triangle!

24
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:53,891
Bruno: And a slice of pizza is a triangle! A yummy triangle!

25
00:01:59,052 --> 00:02:02,681
Lulu: Hello! Did somebody say shapes? I love shapes!

26
00:02:02,981 --> 00:02:08,269
Mimo: Lulu! This shape is like a square, but it's long and stretched out.

27
00:02:10,169 --> 00:02:11,286
Lulu: A rectangle!

28
00:02:11,586 --> 00:02:13,368
Mimo: Can you say rectangle?

29
00:02:16,768 --> 00:02:20,841
Lulu: My book is a rectangle! And a door is a rectangle too.

30
00:02:21,141 --> 00:02:23,372
Bruno: And a chocolate bar is a rectangle!

31
00:02:23,672 --> 00:02:26,961
Lulu: Bruno! Not everything is a snack!

32
00:02:28,361 --> 00:02:29,222
Bruno: Are you sure?

33
00:02:29,522 --> 00:02:33,437
Mimo: This next shape is shiny and has five pointy points!

34
00:02:35,337 --> 00:02:37,534
Pip: A star! A twinkly star!

35
00:02:37,834 --> 00:02:39,365
Mimo: Can you say star?

36
00:02:43,465 --> 00:02:46,806
Pip: Stars twinkle in the sky at night! Twinkle, twinkle!

37
00:02:47,106 --> 00:02:51,490
Mimo: And the last shape is my favorite. It's the shape of love!

38
00:02:53,390 --> 00:02:54,327
Mimo: A heart!

39
00:02:54,627 --> 00:02:56,057
Mimo: Can you say heart?

40
00:03:01,157 --> 00:03:04,198
Mimo: A heart, because I love all my friends!

41
00:03:04,498 --> 00:03:08,569
Mimo: Now let's use our shapes to build something! Watch!

42
00:03:12,369 --> 00:03:15,960
Mimo: A house! Can you find the shapes in my house?

43
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:17,856
Mimo: The roof is a...

44
00:03:19,656 --> 00:03:20,522
Pip: Triangle!

45
00:03:20,822 --> 00:03:22,405
Mimo: The walls are a...

46
00:03:24,205 --> 00:03:25,063
Lulu: Square!

47
00:03:25,363 --> 00:03:26,882
Mimo: The door is a...

48
00:03:28,682 --> 00:03:29,915
Lulu: Rectangle!

49
00:03:30,215 --> 00:03:31,724
Mimo: The window is a...

50
00:03:33,524 --> 00:03:35,079
Bruno: Circle! Like a cookie!

51
00:03:35,379 --> 00:03:37,854
Mimo: And up in the sky, there's a...

52
00:03:39,654 --> 00:03:40,621
Pip: Star!

53
00:03:40,921 --> 00:03:45,506
Mimo: Wow! You found all the shapes! Great job, friends!

54
00:03:47,106 --> 00:03:53,169
Bruno: All this shape hunting made me hungry. Can we have a circle cookie, a square sandwich, and a triangle pizza?

55
00:03:55,469 --> 00:03:59,393
Mimo: Okay, Bruno! A shape snack for everybody!

56
00:03:59,693 --> 00:04:05,037
Mimo: Next time, let's learn the animal sounds! Bye bye, friends!
